  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The key is building flavour in layers: brown the beef in batches so you build a good "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "fond ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fond"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", then cook the onion down completely before adding an enormous amount of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "sweet paprika",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "paprika-sweet-term"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " off the heat. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Beef shin is the best cut here: it has enough collagen to make the sauce silky after a long braise."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
